"<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">系</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">系统；血统；派系；推论；系论；（地质）系；（分类学）系；～型；～式</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76934\">Windows<ruby>系<rp>(</rp><rt>けい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ＯＳではアドミニストレーターアカウントがルートに<ruby>相当<rp>(</rp><rt>そうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">With Windows OS systems &#x27;administrator account&#x27; corresponds to &#x27;root&#x27;.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:経緯\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経緯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原委；经过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>事件<rp>(</rp><rt>じけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>経緯<rp>(</rp><rt>けいい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>詳<rp>(</rp><rt>くわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しく<ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">详细说明事件的来龙去脉。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">緯</a></span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">経過</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（时间的）流逝；经过；进展；过程；事态经过；（天文）中天；凌日；天体经过子午线或日面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204489\">それ<ruby>以来<rp>(</rp><rt>いらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>３<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>ねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>経過<rp>(</rp><rt>けいか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Three years have passed since then.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">警戒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">警戒；警惕；谨慎；防备</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109109\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>我々<rp>(</rp><rt>われわれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>警戒<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているようだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He seems to be wary of us.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">軽快</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轻盈；敏捷；活泼；弹性十足；轻松愉快；欢快；朝气蓬勃；轻松随意（如服装）；节奏轻快（如旋律）；病情好转；症状减轻；康复；恢复期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">契機</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けいき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机会；契机；触发因素；起因；诱因</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75903\"><ruby>退職<rp>(</rp><rt>たいしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>契機<rp>(</rp><rt>けいき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>茶道<rp>(</rp><rt>さどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>は